 home:'<path d="M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5v8.2a1.3 1.3 0 0 1-1.3 1.3H5.3A1.3 1.3 0 0 1 4 18.7v-8.2Z"/><path d="M9 20v-6h6v6"/>',
